\pxi-2.6,l2.6;1. FOR LOCATION OF SECTION C-C AND VIEWS D-D AND E-E, SEE SHEET B4-6.\P2. WELDED WIRE REINFORCEMENT (WWR) 4x4-W1.4xW1.4 IN THE CHEEK LUGS SHALL BE TIED TO THE END BENT REINFORCING STEEL.\P3. FOR CHEEK TOP ELEVATIONS, SEE THE TABLE OF EL
  3
EVATIONS, SHEET B4-6.\P4. SECTIONS F-F AND G-G ARE LOCATED IN VIEW D-D; FOR SECTIONS F-F AND G-G, SEE SHEET B4-9.\P5. FOR THE Δ REINFORCING STRAP LEGEND, SEE SHEET B4-7.\P6. MODEL CHECK (REMOVE BEFORE ISSUE): THE BACKWALL TOP IS LEVEL ACROSS THE WALL
  1
 THICKNESS IN THE CAD MODEL (ITS SLOPE RUNS ALONG THE BENT TO THE CROWN ONLY); THE SECTIONS SHOW THE MODEL. ADD THE CROSS SLOPE TO THE MODEL.\P7. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-21.
