\pxi-2.6,l2.6;1. STIRRUP SPACING IS DIMENSIONED TO BAR CENTERLINES.\P2. REINFORCEMENT IS SHOWN REPRESENTATIVELY: THE FIRST AND LAST BAR OF EACH RUN ARE DRAWN.\P3. FOR SECTIONS A-A, B-B AND C-C, SEE SHEET B4-11. FOR PEDESTAL DETAILS, SEE SHEET B4-12. 
  3
FOR LOCATION OF VIEWS D-D AND E-E, SEE PLAN.\P4. THE CHEEK WALLS ARE SHOWN BROKEN IN THE ELEVATION AND WHOLE IN VIEW D-D. FOR VIEW E-E AND THE CHEEK WALL SECTIONS F-F AND G-G, SEE SHEET B4-13.\P5. FOR THE PIER WALL REINFORCEMENT AND THE ANNULAR PILE 
  1
RING PLATES, SEE SHEETS B4-14 TO B4-16.\P6. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-21.\P7. PILE OFFSETS ARE FROM THE PGL, + TO THE RIGHT LOOKING UP-STATION. CUTOFF ELEVATIONS ARE TO THE NEAREST 0.1 FT.
