\pxi-2.6,l2.6;1. FOR THE LOCATION OF SECTION H-H, SEE THE PIER WALL ELEVATION, SHEET B4-14.\P2. ALL BARS ARE SHOWN IN SECTION H-H; BARS IN THE SECTION PLANE ARE THE NEAREST BAR OF THEIR SERIES WITHIN 1'-3" BELOW THE CUT. THE CUT IS THROUGH RING ROW 3
  3
; THE RING PLATES AND THE PIPE PILES ARE SHOWN CUT.\P3. THE END U RETURNS LAP THE HORIZONTALS ALONG BOTH FACES; THE U LEG LENGTH IS DIMENSIONED OVER THE BACK FACE AT THE LEFT END AND IS THE SAME AT EVERY END U RETURN.\P4. COVER IS DIMENSIONED TO THE 
  1
OUTERMOST BAR (THE HORIZONTALS) AT THE FRONT FACE; IT IS 3" ON EVERY FACE.\P5. PILE NUMBERS ARE THOSE OF SHEET B4-10.\P6. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-21.
