VIEWS D-D AND E-E, SEE SHEET B4-19. FOR SECTIONS F-F AND G-G AND PEDESTAL DETAILS, SEE SHEET B4-20.\P4. FOR THE SOIL REINFORCEMENT (Δ) LEGEND, SEE SHEET B4-18.\P5. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-21.\P6. PILE OFFSETS ARE FROM THE PGL, + TO THE
